WEBVTT

00:11:58.894 --> 00:12:01.542
I'll do 57,000 squared,

00:12:01.566 --> 00:12:04.976
plus 683 squared,

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:09.761
plus 57,000 times 683 times two.

00:12:10.483 --> 00:12:12.577
Add all those numbers together,

00:12:12.601 --> 00:12:15.382
and with any luck, arrive at the answer.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.449
Now, let me recap.

00:12:17.846 --> 00:12:19.316
(Laughter)

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.475
Thank you.

00:12:20.499 --> 00:12:22.372
(Laughter)

00:12:22.396 --> 00:12:24.269
While I explain something else --

00:12:24.293 --> 00:12:25.523
(Laughter)

00:12:25.547 --> 00:12:27.658
-- I know, that you can use, right?

00:12:27.682 --> 00:12:28.687
(Laughter)

00:12:28.711 --> 00:12:30.458
While I do these calculations,